 :itonami.blueprint/implemented-slice
 "VeneerPanelAdvisor ⊣ Wood Panel Plant Operations Governor, langgraph-clj
 StateGraph, append-only audit ledger. A plant OPERATIONS COORDINATION
 actor for veneer/wood-based-panel manufacturing (veneer peeling/
 slicing, panel pressing, gluing/lamination lines producing plywood,
 particleboard, MDF and OSB) -- not direct veneer-peeling/pressing-
 line-equipment operation authority. Four ops
 (`:log-production-batch` / `:schedule-maintenance` / `:flag-safety-
 concern` / `:coordinate-shipment`), all `:effect :propose` only. Ten
 concrete governor checks elaborate this blueprint's four HARD
 invariants: propose-only effect, closed op allowlist, closed
 proposal-effect allowlist (no direct veneer-peeling/pressing-line-
 equipment control), permanent press-cycle-finalize block, independent
 equipment verification/registration before maintenance scheduling,
 independent batch verification/registration before shipment
 coordination, independent shipment-volume recompute against the
 batch's own logged volume, double-schedule guard, panel/veneer-grade
 validation, and output-quality plausibility validation. Safety-
 concern flagging (formaldehyde-emission / equipment-safety / fire-
 hazard) ALWAYS escalates to a human plant supervisor;
 `:log-production-batch` is the only op eligible to auto-commit, and
 only at phase 3 when governor-clean."}
